Domino manages Mihomo as a separate executable. Public CLI wheels and runtime
archives do not contain a Mihomo binary or user proxy configurations. Installation
downloads a selected upstream release; private deployment archives can contain it.

Mihomo: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo
License: GNU General Public License version 3, reproduced in
licenses/mihomo-GPL-3.0.txt. The upstream source and release tags are available at
the project URL. Preserve the upstream notices when redistributing the core.

Python dependencies bundled in CLI runtime archives:
- prompt_toolkit: BSD 3-Clause, https://github.com/prompt-toolkit/python-prompt-toolkit
- wcwidth: MIT, https://github.com/jquast/wcwidth
- PyYAML: MIT, https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml

Dependency license texts accompany the bundled copies under cli/_vendor/licenses.
Pillow is an optional documentation build dependency; it is not bundled at runtime.
